[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0603","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0603.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0367","title":"NetBSD netstat 本地内核内存访问漏洞","description":"NetBSD 系统的 netstat 命令存在本地内核内存泄露漏洞。由于 netstat 工具在处理网络统计信息时未能正确限制对内核内存区域的访问权限，本地攻击者可通过执行特制的 netstat 命令读取内核敏感数据，导致内核信息泄露。该漏洞影响早期 NetBSD 版本，攻击者需具有本地系统访问权限才能利用，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0367"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-02-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:14Z","remediation":"升级 NetBSD 至 1.4.1 或更高版本，该漏洞已在 NetBSD 1.4.1 的安全补丁中修复。如无法升级，可通过 chmod 700 /usr/bin/netstat 限制 netstat 命令的执行权限，仅允许 root 用户使用，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/7571"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0603.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0648","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0648.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0407","title":"Microsoft IIS 4.0 /IISADMPWD 虚拟目录暴力破解密码代理漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 4.0 默认安装包含 /IISADMPWD 虚拟目录，该目录中的文件可被攻击者用作暴力破解密码攻击的代理，或用于识别系统中的有效用户账户，导致敏感信息泄露和未授权访问。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0407"],"sources":["cve","nvd"],"published":"1999-02-09T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"删除 /IISADMPWD 虚拟目录或限制其访问权限；升级到受支持的 Windows Server 版本并使用最新 IIS。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T14:05:38Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=91983486431506&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=92000623021036&w=2"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0648.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0601","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0601.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0366","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 网络共享空密码认证绕过漏洞","description":"Windows NT 4.0 Service Pack 4 存在空密码认证绕过漏洞。由于系统在处理空 NT 哈希值时存在缺陷，远程攻击者可通过使用空密码直接访问目标系统的网络共享资源，无需提供有效凭据。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 4.0 系统，攻击者利用此漏洞可获取共享文件及敏感数据的读取权限，危害程度较高。Microsoft 已在安全公告 MS99-004 中发布修复更新。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0366"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-02-08T00:00:00Z","updated":"1999-02-08T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS99-004 提供的修补程序（对应 KB 文章 Q214840），该补丁修正了 Windows NT 4.0 Service Pack 4 中 SAM 认证逻辑错误。如无法安装补丁，可禁用域控制器上来自 DOS/Windows 3.1/Windows for Workgroups/OS/2/Macintosh 客户端的密码更改功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d92a0abc5d3abac6dcdfabfef6fd71c158e0fd8b/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0366.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0366","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0366.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/58eef6eedd760f280b47bfb4c94db9995b29c5a0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0366.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/6eca843f42fd99fea8c9b630931afac7c9d4576c/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5fcq-r7m3-pxf5/GHSA-5fcq-r7m3-pxf5.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0366.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--e0b64613-6d45-4a3b-8434-c9c2ceedf571.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000517.txt","https://github.com/zephyros1603/RadiantProcessors/blob/7d44cb1cd4b9e088fbe463f1b19be50a04c2efe8/Backend/RAG/data/allitems.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0601.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0578","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0578.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0350","title":"Rational Software ClearCase for Unix db_loader 条件竞争本地权限提升漏洞","description":"IBM Rational ClearCase for Unix 3.2 版本中的 db_loader 程序存在竞态条件漏洞。本地攻击者利用该程序在处理 SUID 位设置时的时序问题，通过精心构造的竞争条件操作，可在目标系统上以 root 权限执行任意代码，实现本地权限提升。攻击者需要具备本地系统访问权限，且成功利用需满足特定的时序窗口条件。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0350"],"sources":["cve","exploitdb"],"published":"1999-02-08T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级到 IBM Rational ClearCase 的修复版本（3.2 之后的版本已修复此问题）。由于该产品已停止维护，建议迁移到受支持的配置管理解决方案，或在系统层面限制不可信用户对 db_loader 程序的执行权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0350","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-0350"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0578.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1391","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1391.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1201","title":"Microsoft Windows 95/98 TCP/IP Chorus 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows 95/98 系统在将多个 TCP/IP 协议栈绑定到同一 MAC 地址时存在拒绝服务漏洞（即 TCP Chorusing 攻击）。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 ICMP Echo（ping）数据包，触发所有绑定的协议栈同时发送 ping 响应，导致网络流量被急剧放大，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows 95/98 系统，利用方式简单，无需认证即可远程触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1201"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-02-06T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:56Z","remediation":"Windows 95/98 已停止支持，微软不再提供安全更新。建议立即升级到受支持的 Windows 版本（如 Windows 10/11）。如无法升级，缓解措施包括：(1) 避免将多个 TCP/IP 协议栈绑定到同一 MAC 地址；(2) 在网络防火墙或主机防火墙上过滤入站 ICMP Echo 请求，限制 ICMP 流量速率；(3) 禁用不必要的 TCP/IP 协议栈绑定。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=91849617221319&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/225","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7542","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/1999/CVE-1999-1201.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e8d44fc9434dcaf08511a3267e0bf049a6756de/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1201.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1201","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/1999.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f9199c6ea2112c9d2536a126688b640a45f0982a/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1201.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-1201.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4j42-4g6h-g8rv/GHSA-4j42-4g6h-g8rv.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1201.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/tcp_chorusing.nasl","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/225/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1391.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1373","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1373.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1169","title":"Flavio Veloso Nobo 1.2 UDP数据包拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Flavio Veloso Nobo 1.2 存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送一系列大型 UDP 数据包，导致服务器进程崩溃，从而造成服务不可用。该攻击无需身份认证，攻击条件简单，仅需网络可达即可触发。受影响版本仅为 Nobo 1.2，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1169"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-02-04T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:52Z","remediation":"该漏洞影响 Flavio Veloso Nobo 1.2，该软件已停止维护，无官方补丁。建议立即迁移至其他受支持的替代软件以消除风险；如无法替换，可在网络边界防火墙（如 iptables）添加规则 `iptables -A INPUT -p udp --dport 8800 -m length --length 1000:65535 -j DROP` 限制大尺寸 UDP 数据包，并将 Nobo 绑定至内网非标准端口，避免暴露于公网。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/12284","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/30c3a896d257362f7419b0c772be2f3dd063ccaa/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1169.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1169","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1169.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d0a8c476da89b37a2bbb6193b7964b10d03aff75/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1169.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mmg4-v63x-pg9v/GHSA-mmg4-v63x-pg9v.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1169.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153300_153400.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000514.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/be7ad03fdf3a412f0fd57a25f1732dc0ecfb1cb3/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1373.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0599","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0599.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0365","title":"Metamail mailcap 条目未过滤 shell 元字符远程命令执行漏洞","description":"metamail 邮件处理工具包中存在 shell 元字符注入漏洞，在将邮件内容传递给 mailcap 条目处理时未对 shell 元字符进行正确引号转义，导致远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送特制邮件触发命令执行。攻击者利用该漏洞可在受害者系统上以当前用户权限执行任意命令，影响广泛部署 metamail 的 Unix/Linux 系统。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0365"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-02-04T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:14Z","remediation":"升级 metamail 至 2.7-9 或更高版本，该版本已对 mailcap 文件中的 shell 元字符进行正确转义处理。如无法升级，可临时移除或禁用系统中所有不可信来源的 mailcap 配置项，同时限制邮件客户端自动调用 metamail 处理附件。在 sendmail 环境下，建议禁用自动执行 mailcap 条目的功能，并审查 /etc/mailcap 及用户 ~/.mailcap 中的每条规则，确保不含未引用的 shell 元字符。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0365","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0cda26301f5b3e56ace35e3d98835812d878db41/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0365.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0365","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0365.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/638fc08494602a9faf37bf81043122f16d26625c/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0365.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/6eca843f42fd99fea8c9b630931afac7c9d4576c/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gmgp-r787-3hjp/GHSA-gmgp-r787-3hjp.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0365.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000513.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/763b4dfa75aa1890a155aad1b583fdcab8111c49/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0365.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0599.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1277","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1277.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1453","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 4 剪贴板信息泄露漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 4 中的 Internet WebBrowser ActiveX 控件存在剪贴板信息泄露漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造恶意网站，诱使用户访问后利用该 ActiveX 对象读取用户剪贴板中的敏感内容（如密码、文本等），导致机密信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Internet Explorer 4 版本，攻击条件为用户需访问恶意网站，CVSS 评分 2.6，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1453"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-02-02T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:28Z","remediation":"升级到 Internet Explorer 5 及以上版本即可消除此漏洞。对于无法升级的旧系统，可通过注册表为 Internet Explorer WebBrowser ActiveX 对象 (CLSID: {8856F961-340A-11D0-A96B-00C04FD705A2}) 设置 kill bit：在 HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Internet Explorer\\ActiveX Compatibility 下创建该 CLSID 项，将 Compatibility Flags DWORD 值设为 0x400 以禁用该控件。建议同时在 IE 安全设置中将「Internet 区域」的「对标记为可安全执行脚本的 ActiveX 控件执行脚本」设为禁用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=91979439932341&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/215","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19164","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4035b63c9f7b02a7407eb5dd431d3b6ffb26cebc/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1453.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1453","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1453.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2cba6a622b2958fa1ec3a506e7b58871edec19fb/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1453.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/de3f834577328e71a123358d1db2b1637bc19e8a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2h45-5j5p-4w53/GHSA-2h45-5j5p-4w53.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1453.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153300_153400.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aa